name: add-feature
description: Plan and build a new capability of this service that spans several layers (domain rule, use case, adapters, endpoint, tests), e.g. "show how many days a batch feeds the family" or "import recipes by URL". Breaks the work into the other skills in order. Not for a change that stays inside one layer.
